Towards Edge-Assisted Cloud Gaming: Performance Evaluation and Optimization (Cai et al., 2021)
Method: Offloads game engine execution to Mobile Edge Computing (MEC) nodes.
Dataset: Simulated edge network topology traces.
Advantages: Reduces physical distance and RTT compared to central clouds.
Limitations: Does not fix packet loss occurring between edge and client.
Research Gap: Software-level state repair operating directly on edge nodes.
Possible Improvements: Combines edge topology with eBPF and AI synthesis to fix packet loss in software.
